{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0003", "row_index": 2, "block_order": 3, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "为全力做好丰台校区医疗服务保障，切实解决师生就医问题，经学校研究决定：", "text_normalized": "为全力做好丰台校区医疗服务保障，切实解决师生就医问题，经学校研究决定：", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0004", "row_index": 3, "block_order": 4, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "1、增加中国航天科工集团七三一医院为丰台校区合同医院。", "text_normalized": "1、增加中国航天科工集团七三一医院为丰台校区合同医院。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0005", "row_index": 4, "block_order": 5, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "2、为保证就医需求，目前在丰台校区内暂设立临时医疗点。", "text_normalized": "2、为保证就医需求，目前在丰台校区内暂设立临时医疗点。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0006", "row_index": 5, "block_order": 6, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "3、在丰台校区校医院正式运营前，增设丰台区王佐镇社区卫生服务中心为临时就医点，校医院正式运营后取消。", "text_normalized": "3、在丰台校区校医院正式运营前，增设丰台区王佐镇社区卫生服务中心为临时就医点，校医院正式运营后取消。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0007", "row_index": 6, "block_order": 7, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "4、丰台校区学生，门诊首诊须在丰台校区医务室，经医师转诊后到指定上级医院就诊。急诊可以就近选择相关医院（限医保定点医院），只限当日当次量（急诊不需要转诊）。", "text_normalized": "4、丰台校区学生，门诊首诊须在丰台校区医务室，经医师转诊后到指定上级医院就诊。急诊可以就近选择相关医院（限医保定点医院），只限当日当次量（急诊不需要转诊）。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0008", "row_index": 7, "block_order": 8, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "5、长期固定在丰台校区居住和工作的职工，可直接前往上述二家医院就诊。急诊可以就近选择相关医院（限医保定点医院），只限当日当次量。", "text_normalized": "5、长期固定在丰台校区居住和工作的职工，可直接前往上述二家医院就诊。急诊可以就近选择相关医院（限医保定点医院），只限当日当次量。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0009", "row_index": 8, "block_order": 9, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "6、全校师生均可在两校区校医院就诊、取药，因为是联网管理，不能重复开药。", "text_normalized": "6、全校师生均可在两校区校医院就诊、取药，因为是联网管理，不能重复开药。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
{"schema_version": "authenticated_notice_block_v1", "raw_asset_id": "asset:authenticated-notice:muc_internal_portal:191705", "raw_version_id": "sha256:e6e76354af195a9a1f18df50b618821d7c078d13f50f5bcd2c35f8072d09f545", "row_id": "block-0010", "row_index": 9, "block_order": 10, "block_role": "paragraph", "heading_level": null, "parent_heading_path": [], "list_level": null, "table_id": null, "table_row_index": null, "table_col_index": null, "text_raw": "7、择期住院须先到丰台校区临时医疗点转诊至相关医院；急诊住院可就近选择相关医院（限医保定点医院）。", "text_normalized": "7、择期住院须先到丰台校区临时医疗点转诊至相关医院；急诊住院可就近选择相关医院（限医保定点医院）。", "html_fragment": null, "link_target": null, "link_text": null, "table_html": null, "table_cells": null}
